[186.93237, "o", "\u001b[29A\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K============================== 25 passed in 0.02s ==============================\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[1mSummary\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[1mcalc.py\u001b[22m contains four functions:\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u2022 add(a, b) - adds two numbers\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u2022 subtract(a, b) - subtracts b from a\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[Kmultiply(a, b) - multiplies two numbers\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[Kdivide(a, b) - divides a by b with explicit ZeroDivisionError handling\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[1mtest_calc.py\u001b[22m contains 25 comprehensive tests organized into 4 test classes:\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u2022 \u001b[1mTestAdd\u001b[22m (5 tests): positive, negative, mixed signs, zero, floats\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u2022 \u001b[1mTestSubtract\u001b[22m (6 tests): positive, negative, result to negative, zero cases, floats\r\r\n\u001b[7G\u001b[K\u001b[1mMultiply\u001b[22m (6 tests): positive, negative, mixed signs, zero, identity (\u00d71), floats\r\r\n\u001b[7G\u001b[K\u001b[1mDivide\u001b[22m (8 tests): positive, negative, mixed signs, remainder, zero numerator,\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[1mZeroDivisionError\u001b[22m, floats, identity (\u00f71)\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KAll 25 tests pass successfully in 0.02 seconds.\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u2605\r\r\n"]
